Description:
Official uBlock Origin Chromium release from gorhill/uBlock.
The exact archive and SHA-256 are pinned in Krypton's deps.ini.

Local Modifications:
Component build metadata and the manifest public key from the official signed
Chromium release. Extension code, default settings and filter catalog are
unchanged; uBlock Origin controls filter updates directly.
